Package: basecoat
Title: 'Basecoat UI' Components for 'htmltools' and 'shiny'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Josiah", "Parry", , "josiah.parry@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Ronan", "Berder", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
           comment = "Author of the bundled basecoat-css library")
  )
Description: Build web pages and 'shiny' apps from 'Basecoat UI' components.
    'Basecoat UI' is a 'Tailwind CSS' version of 'shadcn/ui' that needs no 'React'.
    Every function returns an 'htmltools' tag, so the components work in static pages, server-rendered apps, and 'shiny'.
    The stylesheets and scripts ship with the package, so pages work offline.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://ricochet-rs.github.io/basecoat/, https://basecoatui.com
Imports:
    cli,
    htmltools (>= 0.5.4),
    rlang (>= 1.1.0)
Suggests:
    knitr,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
